  {
    "speaker": "主人公",
    "text": "行ってしまった……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0023"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "主人公",
    "text": "（急に声をかけたから、怖がらせてしまったかな……\r\nしかし──）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0023"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "女生徒",
    "text": "…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0024"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "主人公",
    "text": "（視線は感じるけど、生徒たちの姿が見えない……\r\nどうにも歓迎されていないみたいだな……）",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "0023"
  },
  {
    "select": "気を取り直して……",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "……とにかく元気を\r\n出していこう！",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "何か悪いこと\r\nしたかな……",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "主人公",
    "text": "……あれ？\r\nそういえば、校内マップとかもらってないような……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0023"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "主人公",
    "text": "誰か──って、誰も反応してくれないか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0023"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "主人公",
    "text": "どうしたら……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0023"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901011010010,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あれ……\r\nえっと、何か困りごとですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0022",
    "charCategory": "stand_costume",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "3000030100",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "special_communications/490101101/4901011010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "主人公",
    "text": "え？\r\n──ああ！　ちょっとカウンセラー室を探していて……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0023"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901011010020,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "それなら、中央広場を左に曲がってから\r\n階段を……えっと…………──",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0022",
    "voice": "special_communications/490101101/4901011010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901011010030,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……えへへ、上手く説明できないから、\r\n途中まで案内します！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0022",
    "voice": "special_communications/490101101/4901011010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "主人公",
    "text": "本当か！？\r\nすまない、助かるよ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0023"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901011010040,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "この学院広いから……！\r\n迷っちゃうのもしょうがないよ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0022",
    "voice": "special_communications/490101101/4901011010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "主人公",
    "text": "ああ……でも、初日からこれだと\r\nこの先が思いやられるな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0023"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901011010050,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "初日……？\r\nそれって……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0022",
    "voice": "special_communications/490101101/4901011010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "主人公",
    "text": "そうか\r\n自己紹介がまだだったね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0023"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "主人公",
    "text": "今日から２８３女学院のカウンセラーとして赴任したんだ\r\nこれからよろしくな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0023"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901011010060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えっ、カウンセラーの先生……！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0022",
    "voice": "special_communications/490101101/4901011010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "主人公",
    "text": "ああ、よかったら気軽に訪ねてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0023"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901011010070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "う、うん……\r\n遊びに行くね……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0022",
    "voice": "special_communications/490101101/4901011010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901011010080,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……じゃあ、あとはこの道をまっすぐ行けば\r\nカウンセラー室がある校舎だから……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0022",
    "voice": "special_communications/490101101/4901011010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "主人公",
    "text": "え？　あ、ああ、助かったよ！\r\nよければ名前を教えてくれないかな？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0023"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901011010090,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "高等部１年、八宮めぐるだよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0022",
    "voice": "special_communications/490101101/4901011010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "主人公",
    "text": "めぐるさんか……今日はありがとう\r\nまた今度、お礼をさせてほしい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0023"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901011010100,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
